{
  "name" : "Markevich2004_MAPK_orderedElementary",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">        <p>The model corresponds to the schemas 1 and 2 of Markevich et al 2004, as described in the figure 1 and the supplementary table S1. Phosphorylations and dephosphorylations follow distributive ordered kinetics. The phosphorylations are modeled with three elementary reactions:      <br />          E+S&lt;=&gt;ES-&gt;E+P      <br />          The dephosphorylations are modeled with five elementary reactions:      <br />          E+S&lt;=&gt;ES-&gt;EP&lt;=&gt;E+P      </p>            </body>          </notes>",
  "format" : {
